.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-dist 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-dist \- Build the release binary for a target and stage its archive, printing KEY=VALUE pointers to both
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten dist\fR [\fB\-\-stem\fR] [\fB\-\-build\-tool\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItarget\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build the release binary for a target and stage its archive, printing KEY=VALUE pointers to both
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stem\fR
Print the target\*(Aqs asset stem and exit, without building
.TP
\fB\-\-build\-tool\fR \fI<build_tool>\fR
How to build for the target: cargo, cross or zigbuild (default: cargo)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItarget\fR>
The target triple to build, which must already be installed
